OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to save 'first of its kind'
OL,4,ARoman villa
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiscussions are under way to bring a
OL,7,FRoman villa site into public ownership
OL,8,Fto allow experts to fully excavate the
OL,9,Farea.
OL,11,FHistorians have already hailed the
OL,12,Fsite, found by a housing developer in
OL,13,FNewnham in 2025, as the first of its
OL,14,Fkind in the Forest of Dean due to its
OL,15,Felite mosaic.
OL,17,FLeaders at Newnham-on-Severn Parish
OL,18,FCouncil are now in talks with the
OL,19,Fdeveloper to take over its ownership,
OL,20,Fas it is feared the site will otherwise
OL,21,Fremain untouched.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
